                        <div id="expandable-content-dishwasher" style="position: relative; margin-top: 15px;">
                            <div id="expandable-text-dishwasher" style="max-height: 80px; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.4s ease; line-height: 1.7; color: #444; font-size: 14px;">
                                
                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Built-In Dishwasher Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux built-in dishwasher repair</strong> addresses the standard under-counter installations that Electrolux is famous for. Common issues include dishes not cleaning properly, water not draining (E24 error), and units not starting. We repair spray arms, wash motors, drain pumps, and electronic control boards. Electrolux dishwashers are renowned for quiet operation—our technicians diagnose noise issues from pump failures, spray arm obstructions, and motor problems, restoring the whisper-quiet performance you expect.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Panel-Ready Dishwasher Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux panel-ready dishwasher repair</strong> services units accepting custom cabinet panels for seamless kitchen integration. These premium installations require careful handling to protect custom panels during service. We repair all internal components—wash systems, drain pumps, control boards, and door latches—while maintaining panel alignment and finish quality. Our technicians have experience with panel-ready installations and work carefully within the custom cabinetry requirements.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Tall Tub Dishwasher Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux tall tub dishwasher repair</strong> covers models with increased interior height for larger items and additional rack space. We address wash performance issues, rack adjustment problems, and the spray systems designed for taller tub configurations. Common repairs include upper spray arm failures, rack roller replacements, and control board diagnostics. Our technicians optimize tall tub performance for maximum loading flexibility and cleaning effectiveness.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Dishwasher Drawer Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux dishwasher drawer repair</strong> services compact drawer-style units offering flexibility for smaller loads. These units feature unique drawer mechanisms, compact wash systems, and specialized controls. We repair drawer slides, water inlet systems, compact spray assemblies, and electronic controls. Common issues include drawers not closing properly, water leaks, and drainage problems. Our technicians understand drawer dishwasher mechanics for efficient service.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Top Control Dishwasher Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux top control dishwasher repair</strong> addresses models with hidden controls along the top edge of the door for a sleek, handle-free appearance. We repair touch control panels, door latch systems, and the electronic components behind the clean exterior. Common issues include control panel failures, door not latching properly, and cycle selection problems. Our technicians diagnose and repair concealed control systems while maintaining the streamlined aesthetic.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Front Control Dishwasher Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux front control dishwasher repair</strong> covers models with visible control panels on the door front. We repair button assemblies, control boards, display panels, and cycle selectors. Common issues include buttons not responding, display failures, and cycle interruptions. Front control models allow monitoring cycle progress—our technicians restore full control panel functionality and clear display operation for convenient daily use.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Smart Home Connect Dishwasher Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux Home Connect smart dishwasher repair</strong> includes WiFi connectivity troubleshooting, app communication, and remote monitoring features. Smart dishwashers offer cycle status updates, completion notifications, and smart home integration. We repair control boards enabling connectivity, diagnose pairing problems, and service all wash and drain components. Our technicians address both smart features and mechanical systems for comprehensive dishwasher restoration.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Third Rack Model Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux third rack dishwasher repair</strong> services premium models featuring the innovative MyWay™ or FlexSpace™ third rack for utensils and small items. We repair third rack slides, specialized spray systems targeting the upper rack, and the mechanisms enabling flexible rack configurations. Common issues include rack adjustment failures, spray coverage problems, and rack roller wear. Our technicians optimize third rack performance for maximum loading convenience and thorough cleaning.</p>

                            </div>
