                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Convection Microwave Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux convection microwave repair</strong> addresses units combining microwave energy with convection heating for baking and browning capabilities. We repair convection fans, heating elements, combination cooking controls, and the systems coordinating microwave and convection functions. Common issues include convection not heating, fan failures, and mode selection problems. Our technicians restore full functionality for versatile cooking options that replace traditional ovens for many tasks.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Built-In Microwave Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux built-in microwave repair</strong> services units installed within cabinetry for seamless kitchen integration. We address magnetron failures, control panel problems, door switch issues, and ventilation components. Built-in installations require careful service access—our technicians work within trim kit constraints while protecting surrounding cabinetry. Common repairs include turntable motor replacement, touchpad failures, and interior light problems. We service all Electrolux built-in microwave configurations.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Over-the-Range Microwave Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux over-the-range microwave repair</strong> covers units mounted above cooktops combining microwave cooking with range ventilation. We repair exhaust fans, charcoal filters, grease filters, and lighting illuminating the cooktop below. Common issues include weak ventilation, noisy fans, lights not working, and microwave functions failing. Our technicians service both cooking and ventilation systems, understanding how over-the-range units protect your kitchen from cooking smoke and odors.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Microwave Drawer Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux microwave drawer repair</strong> addresses innovative under-counter units with drawer-style access for ergonomic, below-counter installation. We repair drawer mechanisms, microwave components, touch controls, and the unique systems enabling smooth drawer operation. Common issues include drawers not opening or closing properly, uneven heating, and control panel failures. Our technicians understand the specialized mechanics of drawer microwaves installed under countertops or in kitchen islands.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Wall Oven Combo Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux microwave wall oven combo repair</strong> services stacked units combining microwave above with traditional oven below. These space-saving configurations share cabinetry cutouts and may have integrated controls. We repair both microwave and oven components, addressing heating issues in either unit, shared control problems, and ventilation between units. Our technicians service combination units efficiently, minimizing time without either cooking appliance.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Smart Microwave Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux smart microwave repair</strong> includes Home Connect WiFi features for remote monitoring and recipe integration. Smart microwaves can download cooking programs and receive remote commands. We repair control boards enabling connectivity, diagnose app communication issues, and service all microwave components including magnetrons and control systems. Our technicians address both smart features and traditional microwave repairs for comprehensive restoration.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Countertop Microwave Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux countertop microwave repair</strong> covers freestanding units for flexible kitchen placement. We repair magnetrons, turntable motors, door switches, and control panels. Common issues include not heating, sparking, turntable not rotating, and display failures. Countertop units can often be serviced in-shop for faster turnaround. Our technicians diagnose common microwave failures and restore reliable operation for everyday cooking convenience.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Commercial Microwave Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux commercial microwave repair</strong> serves restaurants, offices, and businesses requiring heavy-duty microwave performance. Commercial units feature reinforced components, higher wattage, and designs for continuous use. We repair commercial-grade magnetrons, heavy-duty door mechanisms, and industrial controls. Downtime affects business operations—we prioritize rapid response for commercial accounts throughout NYC. Our technicians stock commercial-grade parts for efficient repairs.</p>

