                        <div id="expandable-content-winecooler" style="position: relative; margin-top: 15px;">
                            <div id="expandable-text-winecooler" style="max-height: 80px; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.4s ease; line-height: 1.7; color: #444; font-size: 14px;">
                                
                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Built-In Wine Cooler Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux built-in wine cooler repair</strong> addresses units designed for seamless cabinet integration with proper ventilation for under-counter installation. We repair compressor systems, temperature controls, interior lighting, and door seals critical for maintaining optimal wine storage conditions. Common issues include temperature fluctuations, excessive vibration disturbing sediment, and humidity control problems. Our technicians understand built-in installation requirements and maintain proper cooling performance.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Under-Counter Wine Cooler Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux under-counter wine cooler repair</strong> services units installed beneath countertops in kitchens, bars, and entertainment areas. We address front-venting systems, compressor failures, thermostat problems, and shelving mechanisms. Under-counter units must exhaust heat properly—we ensure ventilation systems work correctly while maintaining quiet operation. Common repairs include fan motor replacement, temperature sensor calibration, and door hinge adjustments.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Dual Zone Wine Cooler Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux dual zone wine cooler repair</strong> addresses units with separate temperature compartments for storing reds and whites at their optimal temperatures simultaneously. We repair independent cooling systems, zone dividers, separate thermostats, and the controls managing each zone. Common issues include one zone not cooling properly while the other works, temperature bleed between zones, and control panel failures. Our technicians restore proper independent temperature management.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Single Zone Wine Cooler Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux single zone wine cooler repair</strong> covers units maintaining one consistent temperature throughout for storing a single wine type at ideal conditions. We repair compressor systems, evaporator coils, thermostats, and circulation fans ensuring even temperature distribution. Common issues include temperature inconsistency, units running constantly, and cooling failures. Our technicians calibrate single zone systems for precise temperature maintenance protecting your wine investment.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Freestanding Wine Cooler Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux freestanding wine cooler repair</strong> services units designed for open placement with rear ventilation. We repair all cooling components, shelving systems, door seals, and lighting. Freestanding units offer flexible placement but require adequate air clearance—we ensure proper ventilation for optimal performance. Common repairs include compressor replacement, fan motor service, and thermostat calibration for reliable wine storage anywhere in your home.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Beverage Center Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux beverage center repair</strong> addresses combination units storing wine alongside other beverages at appropriate temperatures. We repair adjustable shelving, multiple temperature zones, interior lighting, and glass door assemblies. Common issues include temperature inconsistency between beverage types, shelving failures, and door seal problems. Our technicians optimize beverage center performance for storing wine, beer, soda, and other drinks at their ideal temperatures.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Wine Cellar Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux wine cellar repair</strong> services larger capacity units designed for serious wine collectors. Wine cellars maintain precise temperature and humidity for long-term wine aging. We repair commercial-grade compressors, humidity control systems, UV-protective glass, and vibration dampening components. Common issues include humidity fluctuations, temperature variations, and compressor failures. Our technicians understand the precise conditions required for proper wine maturation and collection preservation.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Thermoelectric Wine Cooler Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux thermoelectric wine cooler repair</strong> addresses vibration-free cooling systems using Peltier technology instead of compressors. Thermoelectric coolers offer silent operation ideal for wine storage, though with limited cooling capacity. We repair thermoelectric modules, heat sinks, cooling fans, and control circuits. Common issues include insufficient cooling in warm environments and fan failures. Our technicians understand thermoelectric limitations and optimize performance within system capabilities.</p>

