                <div class="service" id="electrolux-hood-vent-repair">
                    <div class="service-image">
                        <img src="/assets/images/oven.webp" alt="Electrolux Hood Vent Repair">
                    </div>
                    <a href="#" class="learn-more-btn" onclick="toggleService(this); return false;">Electrolux Hood Vent Repair <span>Learn More</span></a>
                    <div class="service-types">
                        <h3>We Service All Types:</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Wall Mount Range Hoods</li>
                            <li>Under Cabinet Hoods</li>
                            <li>Island Range Hoods</li>
                            <li>Downdraft Ventilation</li>
                            <li>Ducted Range Hoods</li>
                            <li>Ductless Range Hoods</li>
                            <li>Chimney Hoods</li>
                            <li>Commercial Ventilation</li>
                        </ul>
                        <div id="expandable-content-hoodvent" style="position: relative; margin-top: 15px;">
                            <div id="expandable-text-hoodvent" style="max-height: 80px; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.4s ease; line-height: 1.7; color: #444; font-size: 14px;">
                                
                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Wall Mount Range Hood Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux wall mount range hood repair</strong> addresses hoods mounted on walls above cooktops without upper cabinetry. We repair blower motors, fan assemblies, lighting systems, and electronic controls. Common issues include weak airflow, noisy operation, lights not working, and control panel failures. Our technicians service all Electrolux wall mount styles including chimney designs, ensuring effective smoke and odor removal with quiet operation throughout NYC kitchens.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Under Cabinet Hood Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux under cabinet range hood repair</strong> services hoods installed beneath kitchen cabinets above the cooking surface. We repair exhaust fans, grease filters, charcoal filters for recirculating models, and halogen or LED lighting. Common issues include poor ventilation, excessive noise, and filter saturation reducing effectiveness. Our technicians optimize under cabinet hood airflow and ensure proper grease capture protecting your cabinets from cooking residue.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Island Range Hood Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux island range hood repair</strong> addresses ceiling-mounted hoods suspended above kitchen islands without wall support. These units require powerful motors to capture cooking exhaust from all directions. We repair ceiling-mount hardware, blower motors, lighting, and the unique ductwork configurations island installations require. Common issues include inadequate capture, vibration from improper mounting, and motor failures. Our technicians ensure island hoods effectively ventilate cooking surfaces open on all sides.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Downdraft Ventilation Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux downdraft ventilation repair</strong> services systems that pull cooking exhaust downward through vents built into or beside the cooktop. We repair pop-up mechanisms, downdraft motors, ductwork connections, and telescoping vent assemblies. Common issues include vents not rising, weak suction, and motor failures. Downdraft systems work against natural heat convection—our technicians optimize motor performance and ductwork for effective smoke and odor removal.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Ducted Range Hood Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux ducted range hood repair</strong> addresses hoods connected to exterior ductwork for venting cooking exhaust outside your home. Ducted systems provide superior ventilation by removing grease, smoke, and odors entirely. We repair blower motors, damper flaps, duct connections, and the systems coordinating fan speed with cooking intensity. Common issues include backdrafts, reduced airflow from damaged ducts, and motor failures. Our technicians ensure proper ducted ventilation performance.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Ductless Range Hood Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux ductless range hood repair</strong> services recirculating hoods that filter and return air to the kitchen without exterior venting. These units use charcoal filters to remove odors and grease filters to capture cooking particles. We repair fan motors, filter housings, and recirculation systems. Common issues include odor breakthrough from saturated charcoal filters and reduced airflow. Our technicians optimize ductless performance and advise on proper filter maintenance schedules.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Chimney Hood Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux chimney range hood repair</strong> addresses the iconic chimney-style hoods featuring decorative flues concealing ductwork. We repair chimney section connections, blower motors, baffle filters, and electronic controls including Home Connect smart features. Common issues include loose chimney sections, motor noise, and lighting failures. Our technicians service all Electrolux chimney hood configurations, maintaining both ventilation performance and the striking visual appearance these premium hoods provide.</p>

                                <h4 style="color: var(--blue); margin: 15px 0 10px;">Commercial Ventilation Repair</h4>
                                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Electrolux commercial ventilation repair</strong> serves restaurants, commercial kitchens, and high-volume cooking environments requiring industrial-grade exhaust systems. Commercial ventilation handles heavy grease loads and continuous operation. We repair commercial blower motors, make-up air systems, fire suppression integration, and high-CFM exhaust fans. Downtime risks health code violations—we prioritize rapid response for commercial accounts. Our technicians understand commercial ventilation requirements for safe, compliant kitchen operations.</p>

                            </div>
                            <div id="expandable-fade-hoodvent" style="position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,48,135,0.05)); pointer-events: none;" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                        </div>
                        <button id="expandable-btn-hoodvent" onclick="toggleExpand('hoodvent')" aria-expanded="false" style="display: block; margin: 10px auto 0; background: none; border: none; color: var(--blue); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; padding: 8px 15px;">+ Show More</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
